    <title id="rx-rxexport-0-title">Only the latest — execution at before subscription</title>
    <desc id="rx-rxexport-0-description">A fixed pipeline graph and four synchronized lanes: time, source notifications, internal reactions, and resulting notifications. Dashed glyphs identify modelled explanations; solid glyphs identify observed events. Events at one time retain their sequence order. Subscription endings distinguish completion from cancellation.</desc>
    <defs><style>
  .rx-root,.rx-scene { color:#203d35; font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; }
