  </g><g class="rx-node rx-node-operator" transform="translate(651 66)" data-node-id="switch" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Inspect switchMap(result). Only the latest inner subscription remains active. Each cold inner emits its value after 100 ms.. not reached. Reacts to notifications">
