  </g><g class="rx-node rx-node-sink" transform="translate(887 66)" data-node-id="sink" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Inspect Observer. Receives only C at 220 ms, then Complete. B is cancelled at 120, not when C first arrives at 80.. not reached. Subscriber receives">
