    <title id="rx-rxexport-30-title">Only the latest — execution at step 30, 220 ms</title>
    <desc id="rx-rxexport-30-description">A fixed pipeline graph and four synchronized lanes: time, source notifications, internal reactions, and resulting notifications. Dashed glyphs identify modelled explanations; solid glyphs identify observed events. Events at one time retain their sequence order. Subscription endings distinguish completion from cancellation.</desc>
    <defs><style>
  .rx-root,.rx-scene { color:#203d35; font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; }
  .rx-paper { fill:#fffefa; }
  .rx-band { fill:#f6f7f2; }
  .rx-rule { stroke:#dfe5da; stroke-width:1; }
  .rx-grid { stroke:#dfe5da; stroke-width:1; stroke-dasharray:3 5; }
  .rx-overline { fill:#61756a; font-size:10px; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:1.7px; }
