    <title id="rx-rxexport-33-title">Only the latest — execution at step 33, 220 ms</title>
    <desc id="rx-rxexport-33-description">A fixed pipeline graph and four synchronized lanes: time, source notifications, internal reactions, and resulting notifications. Dashed glyphs identify modelled explanations; solid glyphs identify observed events. Events at one time retain their sequence order. Subscription endings distinguish completion from cancellation.</desc>
